{
  "version": "4.9.1-beta.5",
  "changelog": {
    "Bug Fixes": [
      "**Startup update check restored:** the [MudaRemote] Update check failed startup error is gone; updates are checked properly on every launch.",
      "**Full release history in the picker:** version selection now paginates GitHub releases; older versions are reachable and Android-only releases no longer crowd out PC releases.",
      "**Beta setting respected in the version picker:** the list follows the chosen channel, with an in-dialog beta toggle and Reload button.",
      "**Honest errors instead of fake releases:** network/API failures are shown with a retry option; no fabricated entries can fail during install.",
      "**Mouse wheel isolation:** scrolling affects only the panel under the pointer; dialogs and lists no longer scroll the background editor.",
      "**Old releases installable again:** release manifests pin their download URLs to the immutable tag, so targeted installs no longer hit checksum mismatches."
    ],
    "Improvements": [
      "**Clear update outcomes:** Git checkouts are reported instead of modified, source installs restart cleanly with the new files, and the EXE updater relaunches the app automatically.",
      "**Better Android version picker:** channel-aware lists, real APK asset links, and explicit unavailable/failed states.",
      "**Self-repair after interrupted Windows updates:** leftovers from a killed update helper are restored or swept at next startup."
    ]
  },
